Feature: Cumulative issue scope fixture

  @SCN001
  Scenario: Earlier completed delivery behavior
    Given issue 10 completed its original delivery
    When later issues run
    Then the completed task remains outside their delivery unless adopted

  @SCN002
  Scenario: Existing behavior adopted by the active issue
    Given issue 10 owns an existing deliverable
    When issue 20 adopts it
    Then it becomes part of issue 20 delivery

  @SCN003
  Scenario: Active owned behavior
    Given issue 20 owns new behavior
    When issue 20 runs
    Then that behavior is current delivery

  @SCN004
  Scenario: Future behavior
    Given issue 30 owns future behavior
    When issue 20 runs
    Then the future scenario is excluded

  @SCN005
  Scenario: Prior regression behavior
    Given issue 10 owns completed behavior
    When issue 20 declares it as regression
    Then verification checks it without making it current delivery
